#. 중국어: <size=+12>弹幕基础教学篇·序章</size>
#. Stage select description (MenuCameraCtrl.SetCameraTarget, default/SCN
#. branch)
msgctxt "dll/Shooting.MenuCameraCtrl::SetCameraTarget#110"
msgid "<size=+12>Preamble to Basic Danmaku Tutorial</size>\r\n"
msgstr "<size=+12>기초 탄막 교육편 · 서장</size>\r\n"

#. 중국어: 由传说中的光剑妖精主讲的基础教学课程，欢迎收看！
#. Stage select description (MenuCameraCtrl.SetCameraTarget, default/SCN
#. branch)
msgctxt "dll/Shooting.MenuCameraCtrl::SetCameraTarget#111"
msgid ""
"A lecture from Lightsaber Fairy on the fundamentals of danmaku dodging."
msgstr "전설의 광선검 요정이 진행하는 탄막 피하기 기초 강의."

#. 중국어: <size=+12>弹型与判定范围介绍</size>
#. Stage select description (MenuCameraCtrl.SetCameraTarget, default/SCN
#. branch)
msgctxt "dll/Shooting.MenuCameraCtrl::SetCameraTarget#112"
msgid "<size=+12>Intro to Bullet Types and Hitboxes</size>\r\n"
msgstr "<size=+12>탄의 종류와 피격 판정 소개</size>\r\n"

#. 중국어: 本关中所有子弹显示判定范围，就算弹幕高手在游戏前也要先摸清判定哦～
#. Stage select description (MenuCameraCtrl.SetCameraTarget, default/SCN
#. branch)
msgctxt "dll/Shooting.MenuCameraCtrl::SetCameraTarget#113"
msgid ""
"Hitboxes are shown on all bullets during the lesson. Good to know even if "
"you are a danmaku expert."
msgstr "이 스테이지에서는 모든 탄에 피격 판정이 표시됩니다. 탄막 고수도 먼저 확인해 두면 좋아요."

#. 중국어: <size=+12>随机弹介绍</size>
#. Stage select description (MenuCameraCtrl.SetCameraTarget, default/SCN
#. branch)
msgctxt "dll/Shooting.MenuCameraCtrl::SetCameraTarget#114"
msgid "<size=+12>Intro to Randomized Shots</size>\r\n"
msgstr "<size=+12>랜덤탄 소개</size>\r\n"

#. 중국어: 随机弹的花样很多的哦～
#. Stage select description (MenuCameraCtrl.SetCameraTarget, default/SCN
#. branch)
msgctxt "dll/Shooting.MenuCameraCtrl::SetCameraTarget#115"
msgid "Randomized shots come in many varieties and shapes."
msgstr "랜덤탄은 종류도 모양도 정말 다양해요."

#. 중국어: <size=+12>固定弹介绍</size>
#. Stage select description (MenuCameraCtrl.SetCameraTarget, default/SCN
#. branch)
msgctxt "dll/Shooting.MenuCameraCtrl::SetCameraTarget#116"
msgid "<size=+12>Intro to Fixed Shots</size>\r\n"
msgstr "<size=+12>고정탄 소개</size>\r\n"

#. 중국어: 包括绝对固定和相对固定
#. Stage select description (MenuCameraCtrl.SetCameraTarget, default/SCN
#. branch)
msgctxt "dll/Shooting.MenuCameraCtrl::SetCameraTarget#117"
msgid "Absolute fixed shots and relative fixed shots."
msgstr "절대 고정탄과 상대 고정탄."

#. 중국어: <size=+12>自机狙入门</size>
#. Stage select description (MenuCameraCtrl.SetCameraTarget, default/SCN
#. branch)
