#. branch)
msgctxt "dll/Shooting.MenuCameraCtrl::SetCameraTarget#119"
msgid ""
"Understanding aimed shots is the first step towards becoming a better "
"player."
msgstr "조준탄을 이해하는 것이 실력 향상의 첫걸음입니다."

